    "id": "festo-wampamba/claude-features/steelman-my-bet",
    "name": "steelman-my-bet",
    "description": "Turns fully adversarial on the user's biggest current bet — steelmans the strongest real case that it's wrong, surfaces the load-bearing beliefs the plan depends on that have never actually been tested, names the specific evidence that would change the user's mind, and checks whether they'd actually notice that evidence if it showed up. Use when the user wants a genuine gut-check on their biggest plan/project/bet, asks \"am I wrong about this\", \"poke holes in my plan\", \"play devil's advocate on X\", or seems to want real pushback rather than validation.",
